The audience
I recommend separating the platform into three age experiences.









Junior Zone
Ages 6–12
Simple games, puzzles, creativity, basic learning and parent-supervised experiences.











Teen Zone
Ages 13–17
Competitive games, quizzes, school challenges, coding missions and moderated creative activities.











Youth Zone
18–25
Advanced competitions, skill development, creative showcases, communities and career opportunities.


These should be distinct experiences, not merely different labels. A 9-year-old should not encounter the same content, communication features or advertising as a 22-year-old.
