9. Business model and monetization
I would not depend on advertising as the main source of income.

NaijaPlay should create value for users first, then generate revenue from institutions and partners.
Revenue stream	How it works
School subscriptions	Schools pay for advanced dashboards and competitions
Brand sponsorships	Companies sponsor age-appropriate challenges
Educational partnerships	Institutions fund learning programmes
Premium youth features	Optional subscriptions for eligible adults
