16. My final product advice
There are three things I would protect throughout this project:
1. Entertainment first: If the games aren't enjoyable, users won't stay simply because the platform teaches them something.
2. Real educational value: We need more than quizzes. Users should develop skills they can use outside the platform.
3. Trust: Parents, schools and young people must feel safe using NaijaPlay.